 and everyday work.\"> Balanced with a great screen</label>\n      <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"priority\" value=\"forge\" data-name=\"Forge 16\" data-why=\"the most powerful, with upgradeable RAM and SSD and a full port set — for editing, 3D and gaming.\"> Raw power for creator work</label>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"verdict\" class=\"alert\" hidden></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n\n    <article class=\"card pick-card stack gap-sm\" data-model=\"aero\">\n      <div class=\"between\"><h3>Aero 14</h3><span class=\"badge\">Top rated ★4.6</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Light, bright, long-lasting</p>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">Price</div><div class=\"stat-value\">$1,299</div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Best for travel &amp; everyday work</span>\n      <p class=\"small\"><strong>Standout:</strong> OLED panel with an 18-hour battery.</p>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-block\" data-select=\"aero\">Choose Aero 14</button>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card pick-card stack gap-sm\" data-model=\"forge\">\n      <div class=\"between\"><h3>Forge 16</h3><span class=\"badge\">Most powerful</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Desktop power on the go</p>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">Price</div><div class=\"stat-value\">$1,899</div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Best for video editing, 3D &amp; gaming</span>\n      <p class=\"small\"><strong>Standout:</strong> 16-core CPU, 32 GB RAM, 1 TB SSD.</p>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-block\" data-select=\"forge\">Choose Forge 16</button>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card pick-card stack gap-sm\" data-model=\"nimbus\">\n      <div class=\"between\"><h3>Nimbus 13</h3><span class=\"badge\">Best value</span></div>\n      <p class=\"muted small\">Everything you need, for less</p>\n      <div class=\"stat-label\">Price</div><div class=\"stat-value\">$999</div>\n      <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Best for students &amp; light office work</span>\n      <p class=\"small\"><strong>Standout:</strong> lightest and longest battery of the three.</p>\n      <button class=\"btn btn-sm btn-block\" data-select=\"nimbus\">Choose Nimbus 13</button>\n    </article>\n\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Full spec comparison</div>\n    <p class=\"card-desc\">Best value in each row is flagged. Lower is better for price, weight and weight-related rows; higher is better for battery, RAM, storage and rating.</p>\n    <table>\n      <thead>\n        <tr><th>Spec</th><th>Aero 14</th><th>Forge 16</th><th>Nimbus 13</th></tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Price</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">$1,299</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">$1,899</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">$999 <span class=\"badge\">Best value</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Weight</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">1.2 kg</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">2.1 kg</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">1.0 kg <span class=\"badge\">Lightest</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Battery</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">18 h</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">9 h</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">22 h <span class=\"badge\">Longest</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Screen</td>\n          <td>14&quot; OLED <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Best panel</span></td>\n          <td>16&quot; IPS 165Hz <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Fastest refresh</span></td>\n          <td>13&quot; IPS <span class=\"muted small\">(dimmer)</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>CPU</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">8-core, 15 W</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">16-core, 55 W <span class=\"badge\">Most powerful</span></td>\n          <td class=\"num\">6-core, 15 W</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>RAM</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">16 GB <span class=\"muted small\">(soldered)</span></td>\n          <td class=\"num\">32 GB <span class=\"badge\">Most · upgradeable</span></td>\n          <td class=\"num\">16 GB</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Storage</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">512 GB</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">1024 GB <span class=\"badge\">Largest</span></td>\n          <td class=\"num\">256 GB</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Ports</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">2× USB-C · HDMI · headphone</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">2× USB-C · 3× USB-A · HDMI · Ethernet · SD <span class=\"badge\">Fullest</span></td>\n          <td class=\"small\">2× USB-C · headphone</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>User rating</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">4.6 ★ <span class=\"badge\">Top rated</span></td>\n          <td class=\"num\">4.4 ★</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">4.2 ★</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Reviews</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">1,840</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">960</td>\n          <td class=\"num\">2,310 <span class=\"badge\">Most reviewed</span></td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td>Best for</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">Travel &amp; everyday work</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">Video editing, 3D &amp; gaming</td>\n          <td class=\"small\">Students &amp; light office</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-2 gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Battery life (hours)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":18},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":9},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":22}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Weight (kg) — lower is better\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1.2},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":2.1},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":1.0}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"Price (USD) — lower is better\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":1299},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":1899},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":999}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar\",\"title\":\"RAM (GB)\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"Aero 14\",\"value\":16},{\"label\":\"Forge 16\",\"value\":32},{\"label\":\"Nimbus 13\",\"value\":16}]}'></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"grid cols-3 gap-lg\">\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Aero 14</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"up small\">Pros</span>\n        <ul class=\"small\"><li>Gorgeous OLED panel</li><li>Great battery</li><li>Quiet under load</li></ul>\n        <span class=\"down small\">Cons</span>\n        <ul class=\"small\"><li>Soldered RAM</li><li>Glossy screen</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Forge 16</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"up small\">Pros</span>\n        <ul class=\"small\"><li>Fastest of the three</li><li>Upgradeable RAM and SSD</li><li>Full port selection</li></ul>\n        <span class=\"down small\">Cons</span>\n        <ul class=\"small\"><li>Heavy</li><li>Fans are audible</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n    <article class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Nimbus 13</div>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n        <span class=\"up small\">Pros</span>\n        <ul class=\"small\"><li>Lightest</li><li>Best battery life</li><li>Lowest price</li></ul>\n        <span class=\"down small\">Cons</span>\n        <ul class=\"small\"><li>Dimmer screen</li><li>Small SSD</li></ul>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card stack gap-sm\">\n    <div class=\"card-title\">Our take</div>\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm small\">\n      <p><strong>Most people should pick the Aero 14.</strong> It balances a premium OLED display, an all-day 18-hour battery and light weight at a mid-range price, and it carries the highest rating of the group.</p>\n      <p><strong>Choose the Forge 16</strong> when you actually need the horsepower — video editing, 3D or gaming. Its upgradeable RAM/SSD and rich port set make it the long-term workhorse, at the cost of weight, battery and audible fans.</p>\n      <p><strong>Choose the Nimbus 13</strong> for students and light office use. It is the cheapest, lightest and longest-lasting, but accept the dimmer screen and small 256 GB drive.</p>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var radios = document.querySelectorAll('input[name=\"priority\"]');\n  var verdict = document.getElementById('verdict');\n  var cards = document.querySelectorAll('.pick-card');\n\n  function highlight(model) {\n    cards.forEach(function (c) {\n      c.classList.toggle('recommended', c.getAttribute('data-model') === model);\n    });\n  }\n\n  radios.forEach(function (r) {\n    r.addEventListener('change', function () {\n      highlight(r.value);\n      verdict.hidden = false;\n      verdict.innerHTML = '<strong>' + r.dataset.name + ' is your best fit</strong> — it leads on ' + r.dataset.why;\n    });\n  });\n\n  document.querySelectorAll('[data-select]').forEach(function (btn) {\n    var model = btn.getAttribute('data-select');\n    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n      highlight(model);\n      var radio = document.querySelector('input[name=\"priority\"][value=\"' + model + '\"]');\n      if (radio) radio.checked = true;\n      verdict.hidden = false;\n      verdict.innerHTML = '<strong>' + btn.closest('.pick-card').querySelector('h3').textContent +\n        ' selected.</strong> Add it to your shortlist or go back and compare the full spec table above.';\n      verdict.scrollIntoView({ behavior: 'smooth', block: 'nearest' });\n    });\n  });\n})();\n</script>